<title>UK: Goldman leads $750 mln asset backed FRN for Ford.</title>
<headline>Goldman leads $750 mln asset backed FRN for Ford.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs has lead managed a $750 million five-year asset-backed FRN for Ford Credit Auto Loan Master Trust.</p>
<p>The deal will be priced on Tuesday at around three-month LIBOR plus nine basis points.</p>
<p>Full details follow.</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> AMT    $750 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  LEGAL MAT   15.APR.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN   **+9 BP     PAY DATE    22.APR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	 ISS PRICE  **	  FULL FEES   27.5 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	 REOFFER    **	  GOV LAW     N.Y</p>
<p> LISTING    HK/LUX    DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/HK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT	  5 BP	UNDERWRIT  5 BP	SELL CONC   17.5 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED. 10 PCT CLEAN UP CALL</p>
<p>		EXPECTED MATURITY 15.APR.02, AVG LIFE 5-YEARS</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
